  × This event handler is written as a method handler instead of an inline function.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 │ <template>
  > 3 │   <button @click="foo" />
      │                   ^^^
    4 │   <button @click="foo()" />
    5 │   <button @click="foo($event)" />
  
  i This project writes every event handler in the same style, so that templates are easier to read.
  
  i Wrap the handler in a function that passes on the arguments of the event, such as @click="(event) => save(event)".
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

